Feature: Localized compiler source work
  Scenario: A source unit begins or reads its bounded files
    Given an authentic Script progress publication
    And a closed Cargo source-admission work record
    When its unit and cumulative work counters are formatted
    Then the developer reads the selected English or German phase and unit total
    And the message includes reads, files and work bytes
    And the raw structured event and original cancellation authority remain unchanged

  Scenario: A source record is malformed or has impossible totals
    Given an oversized, unknown, malformed or inconsistent source work payload
    When process progress is published
    Then no friendly source text is inferred
    And the raw structured event remains available
  Scenario: Provider presentation is bounded under one original process
    Given every original provider progress call and cancellation checkpoint
    When provider counters arrive faster than 250 monotonic milliseconds
    Then presentation retains the newest counter
    And phase changes and settlement flush that counter
    And command output errors semantic receipts and original yields remain unchanged

  Scenario: Typed cache scans retain work and coalesce presentation
    Given a bounded absolute cache-scan activity under a genuine Original
    When callbacks arrive faster than250milliseconds
    Then every work checkpoint, cancellation check and continuation still executes
    And presentation emits the first and newest received activity at settlement
    And a new path, phase, elapsed reset or clock reset flushes pending observations
    And a presentation failure cannot replace an existing work failure

  Scenario: Per-unit cache deletion clocks remain one paced work stream
    Given an authentic exclusive cache-delete resource with an absolute bounded path
    And each new deletion unit may reset its local elapsed time
    When its Original publishes every checkpoint and yields every continuation
    Then presentation coalesces only that exact original work identity
    And every path or phase change flushes the final pending row
    And English and German describe deletion without inventing aggregate elapsed seconds
    And the exact primary error survives a final presentation failure

  Scenario: Build tool presentation stays bounded while every Original checkpoint executes
