    And all Original guards publications yields cancellation and exact falsy primary failures remain unchanged

  Scenario: Malformed frame identities cannot renew presentation entitlement
    Given valid pending dependency observations in one five-second frame
    When an oversized owner or command an invalid command or an unknown Script stage is observed
